    "type": "ADVISORY",
    "subject": "SEPTA Ends Fare Product Sales at Levittown Station",
    "message": "<p><span class=\"TextRun Highlight SCXW221978338 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW221978338 BCX0\">Due to a wide array of alternate purchase options, sales at Levittown Station are </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW221978338 BCX0\">discontinued</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW221978338 BCX0\">. Registered SEPTA Key Card holders (</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW221978338 BCX0\">includes</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW221978338 BCX0\"> SEPTA Key Senior Fare, Reduced Fare and CCT Card holders) can continue to access the station waiting area</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW221978338 BCX0\">&nbsp;for seating,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW221978338 BCX0\">restrooms</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW221978338 BCX0\">&nbsp;and other amenities.</span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW221978338 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:180}\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
